      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want more letters or more resources. writing more letters is just screaming into a void that doesn't have ears. it feels like a trap. the more i fight, the more i lose. it's like the world is essentially telling me i don't belong here, and honestly, it's starting to feel like they're right. i'm just tired of being a ghost in a machine that doesn't want me. everything just feels so empty and pointless.",
